    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597310/extras/542e4903d23cdf11e11a1800278eb4e2.avif?t=1748647239\" width=539 height=351 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597310/extras/c0f4c9dd9278a1ad35b207c42acf3933.avif?t=1748647239\" width=539 height=143 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a <strong>Capybara Astronaut</strong> (Capynaut for short). You will meet other space animal pals on your journey, and you are motivated to find out what is troubling them. Make friends, slimey or feathery, and work on shaping a new community of critters aboard your ship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597310/extras/59d18309514861918be5d5d701958d1e.avif?t=1748647239\" width=539 height=143 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An ancient spirit of an extinct world is your guiding light through space; <strong>Phaeona</strong> is her name and she powers your spacecraft. Fly to planet clusters with their own unique flora and unique problems facing their climate, make sure to give a helping paw out! Bounce, swing, glide, burst through the planet's atmosphere to go crashing into another.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597310/extras/b267115620a18353fa36587c358b87c6.avif?t=1748647239\" width=539 height=143 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take a break, kick your paws back, and do some space fishing for a change of pace. Who knows what is swimming in each planet and moon's atmosphere. It's not just fauna you can collect, there are flowers &amp; mushrooms to gather seeds &amp; spores of to grow in your own garden. The friends you make along the way help you out, telling you about hidden fishing spots and sharing their favorite plants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597310/extras/f52e1a867946efb786d685f27bde9b5d.avif?t=1748647239\" width=539 height=143 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597310/extras/542e4903d23cdf11e11a1800278eb4e2.avif?t=1748647239\" width=539 height=351 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597310/extras/c0f4c9dd9278a1ad35b207c42acf3933.avif?t=1748647239\" width=539 height=143 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a <strong>Capybara Astronaut</strong> (Capynaut for short). You will meet other space animal pals on your journey, and you are motivated to find out what is troubling them. Make friends, slimey or feathery, and work on shaping a new community of critters aboard your ship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597310/extras/59d18309514861918be5d5d701958d1e.avif?t=1748647239\" width=539 height=143 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An ancient spirit of an extinct world is your guiding light through space; <strong>Phaeona</strong> is her name and she powers your spacecraft. Fly to planet clusters with their own unique flora and unique problems facing their climate, make sure to give a helping paw out! Bounce, swing, glide, burst through the planet's atmosphere to go crashing into another.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597310/extras/b267115620a18353fa36587c358b87c6.avif?t=1748647239\" width=539 height=143 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take a break, kick your paws back, and do some space fishing for a change of pace. Who knows what is swimming in each planet and moon's atmosphere. It's not just fauna you can collect, there are flowers &amp; mushrooms to gather seeds &amp; spores of to grow in your own garden. The friends you make along the way help you out, telling you about hidden fishing spots and sharing their favorite plants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597310/extras/f52e1a867946efb786d685f27bde9b5d.avif?t=1748647239\" width=539 height=143 /></span></p>",
